# Entering this directory gives you the devShell from flake.nix — treefmt,
# statix, deadnix, actionlint, the Renovate validator, vncdotool, magick, jq.
#
# `direnv allow` once per clone, then it is automatic. Without direnv on the
# machine this file simply does nothing, so it is harmless on the Ubuntu host
# that does not have it yet.
use flake
